<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
    <h1>About Barfani Ayurveda</h1>
    <p class="lead-sm">Barfani Ayurveda is the product line of <strong>Shraddha Clinic</strong> in Surendranagar, Gujarat. It is built on one belief: Ayurvedic care should be simple, honest and made with care.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container section">
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><strong>30+</strong><span>years of Ayurvedic practice</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><strong>2</strong><span>BAMS-qualified Vaidyas</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><strong>4</strong><span>countries served: India, USA, UK, UAE</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Vaidyas</p>
    <h2>Father and daughter, one mission</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="persons">
    <div class="person">
      <span class="avatar">RP</span>
      <div>
        <h3><%= config.doctorName %></h3>
        <p class="role">BAMS · Ayurvedic physician</p>
        <p>Patients consult him for Ayurvedic treatment, and also for guidance on everyday life.</p>
        <p>His formal education goes beyond medicine: BAMS, LLB, and bachelor's and master's degrees in Yoga, Astrology and Astronomy, with doctoral studies in select subjects.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="person">
      <span class="avatar">PP</span>
      <div>
        <h3><%= config.coDoctorName %></h3>
        <p class="role">BAMS · Ayurvedic physician</p>
        <p>Completed her BAMS this year and now works alongside her father, developing and sharing new products such as the herbal waxing powder and handmade soaps.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container section narrow">
  <h2>How we make our products</h2>
  <p>Products are prepared by hand in small batches in Surendranagar, or at a trusted Ayurvedic manufacturing partner. We have served patients across India and in the USA, UK and UAE.</p>
  <p><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/shop">Explore products</a> <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Consult the Vaidya</a></p>
</section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
